{"a":[52,52],"h":"<p>52.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"92\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 92.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 32.2 32.2 50.2 50.2 60.7 60.7 67.4\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"50.2 67.4 75.7\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve işte bu - ya'ni tayyibattan yiyip ameli salih işlemek üzere islâm ve tevhid esasında toplanmak<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"155\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 155.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 32.3 32.3 44.3 51.0 59.3 68.3 68.3 75.0 75.0 81.7 81.7 97.6 97.6 106.6 106.6 118.6 118.6 125.3 125.3 132.0 132.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 51.0 75.0 125.3 138.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> hepinizin ümmeti vâhide olarak ümmetidir. - Ya'ni bütün Peygamberlerin din ve şeriatinin esası budur.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"106\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 106.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 37.6 37.6 44.3 61.6 61.6 68.3 75.0 81.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"44.3 68.3 75.0 81.7 90.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> rabbınız da benim <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"79\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 78.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.0 35.3 35.3 42.0 42.0 48.7 55.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"42.0 55.6 62.3\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> binaenaleyh bana ittika ediniz - benden başkasından korkmayınız.</p><p>Böyle iken:</p>"}